<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About QuickNotes</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <h1>QuickNotes</h1>
      <p>Capture ideas before they disappear.</p>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <h2>About QuickNotes</h2>
      <p>
        QuickNotes is a simple place to capture ideas, reminders, and tasks
        before you forget them. Add a note, review your list, and use the
        keyboard to move through the page.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>How to use QuickNotes</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Go to the Home page using the navigation link.</li>
          <li>Type a reminder or idea into the New note box.</li>
          <li>Select Add Note to submit the form.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Features</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>A form for entering a note.</li>
          <li>A list for viewing notes.</li>
          <li>A simple layout that is easy to navigate.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Keyboard shortcuts</h2>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Shortcut</th>
              <th scope="col">Action</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Tab</td>
              <td>Move to the next link or form control.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Enter</td>
              <td>Activate a link or submit the note form when focused.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Send feedback</h2>
        <form id="feedback-form">
          <p>
            <label for="feedback-name">Name</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="feedback-name"
              name="name"
              required
            />
          </p>

          <p>
            <label for="feedback-email">Email</label>
            <input
              type="email"
              id="feedback-email"
              name="email"
              required
            />
          </p>

          <p>
            <label for="feedback-message">Message</label>
            <textarea
              id="feedback-message"
              name="message"
              rows="4"
              required
            ></textarea>
          </p>

          <button type="submit">Send feedback</button>
        </form>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 QuickNotes. Built during Web Foundations.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>